  hint: Found in the northern sector in a field with few stones
  characterDescription: "Hedgehog\r\nFound in the Northeastern sector\r\nOutfit inspired
    by early 1900s archaeologists\r\nSurprisingly excitable Harry the hedgehog gets
    carried away talking about the things he\u2019s interested in most of the time.
    He takes particular interest in the possibilities of the Avebury site, and often
    visits the museum to view the artefacts that are displayed there.\r"
